        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1487, 6\" Roller Door Bumper</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese  6\" roller bumpers are used in situations where 2 doors meet each other at right angles (hit each other back to back). Normally it is screwed to one of the doors at the top. After installation when both doors are open, the roller wheel will protect the doors and their hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1487_size.gif?v=1704354522\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1487 roller door bumper size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Shorter \r\n<a href=\"/products/4-1-2-inch-roller-bumper-don-jo-1486\"><b>4-1/2\" Roller Door Bumper</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/angled-roller-bumper-don-jo-1488\"><b>Angled Roller Door Bumper</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nConstructed of heavy duty solid cast brass in your choice of 3 finish colors. Packaged complete with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Don-Jo 1487 Roller Bumper:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Diameter: 1-31/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Roller Wheel Diameter: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1487.pdf?v=1704262275\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1487 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
